# Frontend build configuration.
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and edit. Nothing here is required: with no `.env` file at
# all the app runs against its in-memory service layer and needs no backend.

# Which service implementation is live.
#
#   local - in-memory, seeded from src/data/mock.ts. Default. No backend needed.
#   http  - the .NET 10 API in dotnet-api/, which owns paging, filtering,
#           sorting and every business rule.
VITE_API_MODE=local

# Base URL of the .NET 10 API. Only read when VITE_API_MODE=http.
# Must match the origin the API's Cors:AllowedOrigins permits.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:5199

# Start the API first:
#
#   cd ../dotnet-api/src/RecordRoom.Api
#   dotnet run --urls http://localhost:5199
#
# It applies migrations and seeds the demo dataset on startup if the registry is
# empty. Demo logins all use the password Demo@12345: admin, supervisor,
# operator, employee.